# Revisions to skip when assigning blame.
#
# Only commits that changed no behaviour whatsoever belong here — a formatting
# pass, a mass rename. A commit listed by mistake hides real authorship, so the
# bar is that its diff can be shown to be layout and nothing else.
#
# Turn it on locally, once per clone:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub reads this file by name and needs no configuration.

